   "file": "experience.md",
   "heading": "Talent Researcher Intern (AI Onboarding Assistant project), IRIS Software Group, August 2026",
   "text": "Talent Researcher Intern (AI Onboarding Assistant project), IRIS Software Group, August 2026. I built an onboarding assistant in Microsoft Copilot Studio for real internal use across the company. It serves three groups of people: hiring managers, people managers and new hires, who each need different information.\n\nI reduced its response time from 158 seconds to 12 seconds by restructuring the metadata and separating the documents.\n\nI designed a two-tier retrieval setup with prioritised sources and fallback logic. I also used Microsoft Entra ID and the Graph API so the assistant could personalise answers to the person asking.\n\nI improved retrieval accuracy by uploading and labelling about 25 source documents individually.",
